WEBVTT

00:07:59.193 --> 00:08:02.232
How about a $250 million bonus to Mother Teresa?

00:08:02.232 --> 00:08:04.966
Do we have an issue with that? None at all.

00:08:04.966 --> 00:08:06.298
None at all.

00:08:06.298 --> 00:08:08.509
Great leaders would never sacrifice

00:08:08.509 --> 00:08:09.870
the people to save the numbers.

00:08:09.870 --> 00:08:11.549
They would sooner sacrifice the numbers

00:08:11.549 --> 00:08:14.528
to save the people.

00:08:14.528 --> 00:08:16.651
Bob Chapman, who runs

00:08:16.651 --> 00:08:18.964
a large manufacturing company in the Midwest

00:08:18.964 --> 00:08:21.040
called Barry-Wehmiller,

00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:26.397
in 2008 was hit very hard by the recession,

00:08:26.397 --> 00:08:30.398
and they lost 30 percent of their orders overnight.